0 31 409 [
[(When you first open a Pd document like this one, your)]
[(cursor will be an arrow. This is also known as "run" mode)]
[(and you can then click and interact with objects like)]
[(messages, number boxes and bang buttons. Select "edit)]
[(mode" in the Edit menu to check it on and the cursor will)]
[(change to the image of a hand. The patch is now in edit)]
[(mode. You can move any object by clicking on it and)]
[(dragging it. You can also select a set of objects and then)]
[(move them all.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 31 273 [
[(Select "Edit mode" again to uncheck it in the Edit menu)]
[(and you're back in run mode with the arrow cursor which)]
[(acts on objects without moving them.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 31 216 [
[(Note that the Edit menu also shows you a keyboard)]
[(shortcuts to alter into and out of "Edit mode". If you are)]
[(predominantly editing a patch but would like to quickly)]
[(get out of it just to click on a message or something, you)]
[(can just press and hold the control key \050command in mac)]
[(computers\051 and you'll note the arrow is back until you)]
[(release the key so you can briefly do what you want.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
gsave
/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 499 302 [
[(The Put menu creates new text items of any of the four)]
[(types. Note that there are other GUI boxes in this menu,)]
[(like the list box than can hold one or more atoms. An atom)]
[(in Pd is a message item, usually either a float or a symbol.)]
[(The put menu also offers a "symbol" atom box, a GUI box)]
[(analogous to the atom number box but for showing and)]
[(entering single text strings. Other GUIs like bang, toggle)]
[(are also in this menu, as well as arrays and graphs \050which)]
[(we'll see later on\051.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
